{"timestamp": "2025-09-12T13:17:48.412526", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # Get the index of the item to craft in the environment's index map.\n  item_idx = env.scenario.world.cookbook.index[item]\n\n  # Check if the environment's cookbook has a recipe for the item.\n  if item_idx not in env.scenario.world.cookbook.recipes:\n    return []\n\n  # Retrieve the recipe for the item.\n  recipe = env.scenario.world.cookbook.recipes[item_idx]\n\n  # Check if all the required items for the recipe are present in the agent's inventory.\n  inventory = env._current_state.inventory\n  for ingredient, count in recipe.items():\n    if ingredient != \"_key\":  # Skip the \"_key\" entry in the recipe.\n      if inventory[ingredient] < count:\n        return []\n\n  # Get the position of the workshop where the item can be crafted.\n  workshop_idx = recipe[\"_key\"]\n  workshop_name = env.scenario.world.cookbook.reverse_contents[workshop_idx]\n\n  # Find the workshop in the grid.\n  workshop_pos = None\n  for x in range(env._current_state.grid.shape[0]):\n    for y in range(env._current_state.grid.shape[1]):\n      if env._current_state.grid[x, y, workshop_idx] > 0:\n        workshop_pos = (x, y)\n        break\n    if workshop_pos:\n      break\n\n  if workshop_pos is None:\n    return []\n\n  # Move the agent to the workshop.\n  actions = []\n  pos = env._current_state.pos\n  dir = env._current_state.dir\n  dx, dy = workshop_pos[0] - pos[0], workshop_pos[1] - pos[1]\n  if dx > 0:\n    actions.append(craft.RIGHT)\n    dir = (dir + 1) % 4\n  elif dx < 0:\n    actions.append(craft.LEFT)\n    dir = (dir - 1) % 4\n  if dy > 0:\n    actions.append(craft.DOWN)\n    dir = (dir + 1) % 4\n  elif dy < 0:\n    actions.append(craft.UP)\n    dir = (dir - 1) % 4\n\n  # Use the workshop to craft the item.\n  actions.append(craft.USE)\n\n  return actions", "island_id": 2, "scores": {"3": -1}}
