{"timestamp": "2025-09-12T13:24:20.696500", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # Get the index of the item in the cookbook\n  index = env.scenario.world.cookbook.index\n  item_index = index.index(item)\n\n  # Get the recipe for the item\n  cookbook = env.scenario.world.cookbook\n  recipe = cookbook.recipes.get(item_index, {})\n\n  # Check if the item is a primitive\n  if item_index in cookbook.primitives:\n      return []\n\n  # Check if all required ingredients are in the inventory\n  inventory = env._current_state.inventory\n  has_all_ingredients = all(inventory[ingredient] >= count for ingredient, count in recipe.items())\n\n  if not has_all_ingredients:\n      return []\n\n  # Find the workshop for the recipe\n  workshop_name = next((key for key in recipe if key.startswith('_key')), None)\n  if workshop_name is None:\n      return []\n\n  workshop_index = index.index(workshop_name)\n\n  # Check if the agent is next to the workshop\n  state = env._current_state\n  if state.next_to(workshop_index):\n      # Perform the USE action\n      return [env.action_specs()[workshop_name]]\n  else:\n      # Need to move to the workshop (implementation omitted for brevity)\n      return []", "island_id": 2, "scores": {"3": -1}}
