{"timestamp": "2025-09-12T13:47:10.160190", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # Get the index of the item to craft in the environment's index\n  item_index = env.scenario.world.cookbook.index.index(item)\n\n  # Get the recipe for the item\n  recipe = env.scenario.world.cookbook.recipes.get(item_index, {})\n\n  # If there is no recipe, return an empty list\n  if not recipe:\n    return []\n\n  # Check if all the required ingredients are in the inventory\n  inventory = env._current_state.inventory\n  required_ingredients = recipe\n  has_all_ingredients = all(inventory[ingredient] >= count for ingredient, count in required_ingredients.items())\n\n  # If not all ingredients are present, return an empty list\n  if not has_all_ingredients:\n    return []\n\n  # Find the workshop where the item can be crafted\n  workshop_index = None\n  for idx, workshop in enumerate(env.scenario.world.workshop_indices):\n    if workshop == item_index:\n      workshop_index = idx\n      break\n\n  if workshop_index is None:\n    return []\n\n  # Determine the position of the workshop on the grid\n  grid = env._current_state.grid\n  workshop_pos = None\n  for y in range(grid.shape[0]):\n    for x in range(grid.shape[1]):\n      if grid[y, x, workshop_index] == 1:\n        workshop_pos = (x, y)\n        break\n    if workshop_pos:\n      break\n\n  if workshop_pos is None:\n    return []\n\n  # Calculate the direction to face the workshop\n  current_pos = env._current_state.pos\n  dx = workshop_pos[0] - current_pos[0]\n  dy = workshop_pos[1] - current_pos[1]\n\n  # Move towards the workshop\n  actions = []\n  while dx != 0 or dy != 0:\n    if dx > 0:\n      actions.append(craft.RIGHT)\n      dx -= 1\n    elif dx < 0:\n      actions.append(craft.LEFT)\n      dx += 1\n    elif dy > 0:\n      actions.append(craft.DOWN)\n      dy -= 1\n    elif dy < 0:\n      actions.append(craft.UP)\n      dy += 1\n\n  # Face the workshop and use it\n  actions.append(craft.USE)\n\n  return actions", "island_id": 4, "scores": {"3": -1}}
