{"timestamp": "2025-09-12T15:09:01.346471", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # Step 1: Check if the item is a primitive. If it is, collect it.\n  item_index = env.scenario.world.cookbook.index.index(item)\n  if item_index in env.scenario.world.cookbook.primitives:\n      # If it's a primitive, collect it directly.\n      return collect(env, item)\n  \n  # Step 2: Get the recipe for the item.\n  recipe = env.scenario.world.cookbook.recipes.get(item_index, {})\n  if not recipe:\n      return []  # No recipe found for the item.\n  \n  # Step 3: Check if all required ingredients are available in inventory.\n  required_ingredients = {k: v for k, v in recipe.items() if k != \"_key\"}\n  inventory = env._current_state.inventory\n  for ingredient, count in required_ingredients.items():\n      if inventory[ingredient] < count:\n          # Need to collect or craft this ingredient.\n          # Assume we can collect it directly if it's a primitive.\n          if ingredient in env.scenario.world.cookbook.primitives:\n              collect_actions = collect(env, env.scenario.world.cookbook.index.get(ingredient))\n              if not collect_actions:\n                  return []  # Failed to collect the ingredient.\n              return collect_actions + craft_v2(env, item)  # Retry after collecting.\n          else:\n              # Need to craft the ingredient first.\n              craft_actions = craft_v2(env, env.scenario.world.cookbook.index.get(ingredient))\n              if not craft_actions:\n                  return []  # Failed to craft the ingredient.\n              return craft_actions + craft_v2(env, item)  # Retry after crafting.\n  \n  # Step 4: Move to the workshop specified in the recipe.\n  workshop_index = recipe.get(\"_key\", None)\n  if workshop_index is None:\n      return []  # No workshop specified for this recipe.\n  \n  workshop_pos = find_workshop_position(env, workshop_index)\n  if not workshop_pos:\n      return []  # Workshop not found.\n  \n  # Step 5: Move to the workshop.\n  move_actions = move_to_position(env, workshop_pos)\n  if not move_actions:\n      return []  # Failed to reach the workshop.\n  \n  # Step 6: Use the workshop to craft the item.\n  return move_actions + [USE]  # Perform the USE action at the workshop.", "island_id": 6, "scores": {"3": -1}}
