{"timestamp": "2025-09-12T15:12:42.983066", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # Get the index of the item in the cookbook\n  cookbook = env.scenario.world.cookbook\n  index = cookbook.index\n  item_idx = index.index(item)\n\n  # Get the recipe for the item\n  recipe = cookbook.recipes.get(item_idx, {})\n\n  # Check if the recipe has a key, which is the required item to craft\n  if \"_key\" in recipe:\n    key_idx = recipe[\"_key\"]\n    key_name = index.get(key_idx)\n    # If the key is not in the inventory, we need to craft it first\n    if env._current_state.inventory[key_idx] == 0:\n      # Recursively call craft_v2 to get the actions to craft the key\n      key_actions = craft_v2(env, key_name)\n      if not key_actions:\n        return []\n      return key_actions + [env.action_specs()[env.CRAFT_FUNC]]\n  else:\n    # Check if all the required items are in the inventory\n    for ingredient_idx, count in recipe.items():\n      if env._current_state.inventory[ingredient_idx] < count:\n        return []\n\n  # If we have all the required items, go to the workshop and use the USE action to craft the item\n  workshop_idx = recipe.get(\"_workshop\", 0)\n  workshop_name = index.get(workshop_idx)\n  workshop_pos = None\n  for y in range(env._current_state.grid.shape[0]):\n    for x in range(env._current_state.grid.shape[1]):\n      if env._current_state.grid[y, x, workshop_idx] > 0:\n        workshop_pos = (x, y)\n        break\n    if workshop_pos:\n      break\n\n  if not workshop_pos:\n    return []\n\n  # Move to the workshop\n  move_actions = move_to(env, workshop_pos)\n  if not move_actions:\n    return []\n\n  # Use the USE action to craft the item\n  return move_actions + [env.action_specs()[env.USE]]", "island_id": 0, "scores": {"3": -1}}
