{"timestamp": "2025-09-12T15:21:01.522220", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # Step 1: Check if the item is a primitive.\n  # If it is a primitive, return an empty list of actions since it cannot be crafted.\n  # If it is not a primitive, proceed to the next step.\n\n  # Step 2: Get the recipe for the item.\n  # If the recipe is not found, return an empty list of actions.\n  # If the recipe is found, proceed to the next step.\n\n  # Step 3: Check if the agent has all the required ingredients for the recipe.\n  # If the agent does not have all the required ingredients, return an empty list of actions.\n  # If the agent has all the required ingredients, proceed to the next step.\n\n  # Step 4: Find the workshop where the item can be crafted.\n  # If the workshop is not found, return an empty list of actions.\n  # If the workshop is found, proceed to the next step.\n\n  # Step 5: Move to the workshop.\n  # If the agent cannot reach the workshop, return an empty list of actions.\n  # If the agent can reach the workshop, proceed to the next step.\n\n  # Step 6: Use the workshop to craft the item.\n  # If the agent cannot use the workshop, return an empty list of actions.\n  # If the agent can use the workshop, return a list of actions to craft the item.\n  return []", "island_id": 2, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
