{"timestamp": "2025-09-12T15:21:31.474745", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # Get the index of the item in the environment's cookbook index\n  item_index = env.scenario.world.cookbook.index.index(item)\n\n  # Get the recipe for the item\n  recipe = env.scenario.world.cookbook.recipes.get(item_index)\n\n  # If the item is not in the recipes, return an empty list\n  if not recipe:\n    return []\n\n  # Check if all the required ingredients are in the inventory\n  inventory = env._current_state.inventory\n  for ingredient, count in recipe.items():\n    if inventory[ingredient] < count:\n      return []\n\n  # If all ingredients are present, proceed to craft the item\n  workshop_indices = env.scenario.world.workshop_indices\n\n  if not workshop_indices:\n    return []\n\n  workshop_index = workshop_indices[0]\n\n  # Find the workshop on the grid\n  grid = env._current_state.grid\n  workshop_pos = None\n  for x in range(grid.shape[0]):\n    for y in range(grid.shape[1]):\n      if grid[x, y, workshop_index] == 1:\n        workshop_pos = (x, y)\n        break\n    if workshop_pos:\n      break\n\n  if not workshop_pos:\n    return []\n\n  # Move to the workshop\n  current_pos = env._current_state.pos\n  path = find_path(current_pos, workshop_pos, grid)\n  if not path:\n    return []\n\n  move_actions = []\n  for step in path:\n    if step == 'up':\n      move_actions.append(1)  # UP\n    elif step == 'down':\n      move_actions.append(0)  # DOWN", "island_id": 5, "scores": {"3": -1}}
