{"timestamp": "2025-09-12T15:22:36.127478", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # get the index of the item to be crafted \n  item_index = env.scenario.world.cookbook.index.index(item)\n  # get the recipe for the item, if it exists\n  recipe = env.scenario.world.cookbook.recipes.get(item_index, {})\n  if not recipe:\n    return []  # no recipe exists for the item\n  # check if we have all the required items in inventory\n  inventory = env._current_state.inventory\n  required_items = {}\n  for kind, count in recipe.items():\n    if kind == '_key':\n      continue\n    if inventory[kind] < count:\n      required_items[kind] = count\n  if not required_items:\n    # we have all the required items, proceed to craft\n    workshop_index = recipe.get('_key', 0)\n    workshop_name = env.scenario.world.cookbook.index.get(workshop_index)\n    # find the workshop in the grid\n    grid = env._current_state.grid\n    pos = env._current_state.pos\n    for y in range(grid.shape[0]):\n      for x in range(grid.shape[1]):\n        if grid[y, x, workshop_index] > 0:\n          # move to the workshop\n          dx, dy = x - pos[1], y - pos[0]\n          actions = []\n          if dx > 0:\n            actions += [3] * dx  # RIGHT\n          elif dx < 0:\n            actions += [2] * (-dx)  # LEFT\n          if dy > 0:\n            actions += [0] * dy  # DOWN\n          elif dy < 0:\n            actions += [1] * (-dy)  # UP\n          # use the workshop to craft the item\n          actions.append(4)  # USE\n          return actions\n    return []  # workshop not found in grid\n  else:\n    # we need to collect or craft the missing items\n    # for simplicity, we assume that all required items are primitives\n    # and can be collected directly\n    actions = []\n    for kind, count in required_items.items():\n      if kind in env.scenario.world.cookbook.primitives:\n        # collect the primitive\n        actions += collect(env, kind)\n      else:\n        # craft the item recursively\n        sub_actions = craft_v2(env, kind)\n        if not sub_actions:\n          return []  # cannot craft the item\n        actions += sub_actions\n    # after collecting/crafting all required items, proceed to craft\n    return actions + craft_v2(env, item)", "island_id": 3, "scores": {"3": -1}}
