{"timestamp": "2025-09-12T15:23:56.110844", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  def get_required_primitives(item) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Returns the required primitives and their counts for the item.\"\"\"\n    return {}\n\n  def collect_required_primitives(primitive_counts) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"Returns a list of actions to collect the required primitives.\"\"\"\n    return []\n\n  def find_and_go_to_workshop(item) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"Returns a list of actions to find and go to the workshop for the item.\"\"\"\n    return []\n\n  # Main logic\n  required_primitives = get_required_primitives(item)\n  if not required_primitives:\n    return []\n\n  collection_actions = collect_required_primitives(required_primitives)\n  if not collection_actions:\n    return []\n\n  workshop_actions = find_and_go_to_workshop(item)\n  if not workshop_actions:\n    return []\n\n  return collection_actions + workshop_actions + [env.action_space.actions[\"USE\"]]", "island_id": 1, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
